/-!
# HabiroCohomologyFoundationsPartII: target signatures

The roadmap is README.md; this file is not the roadmap. It states the roadmap's
headline theorems against the pinned Mathlib and Tau Ceti APIs when their carriers exist.

None of the headline theorems is statable at the pins:
* relativeFormalEtaleLift (§0.1) needs connective E∞ ring spectra, completed
  spectral cotangent complexes and marked relative spherical lifts; the
  ordinary, p-completely étale and p-completely formally étale interfaces
  require these distinct carriers.
* sphericalPerfection (§0.1) needs connective E∞ ring spectra, spherical Witt
  vectors and cyclotomic base data.
* localTraceComparison (§0.3) needs solid even filtrations, spherical lifts,
  relative TC⁻ over ku and enhanced q-de Rham objects.
* tracePair (§1.2) needs the category of enhanced q-Hodge pairs and the
  arithmetic gluing of even-filtered relative TC⁻.
* traceHabiro (§1.3) needs enhanced q-Hodge pairs, their partial descents and the
  Habiro-complete symmetric monoidal derived category.
* quotientLift (§2.1) needs connective ring spectra and E₁/E₂ algebra quotients.
* perfectedLiftNaive (§2.2) needs animated q-de Rham objects, the enhanced naive
  filtration, its filtered quotient and spherical E₁ lifts after δ-perfection.
* tracePair_quasiRegular (§2.3) needs the category of enhanced q-Hodge pairs,
  compatible spherical lifts and the canonical quasi-regular section.
* finiteCoefficientTrace (§2.4) needs Moore E₁ algebra spectra, relative TC⁻
  over ku/KU and the enhanced finite-coefficient q-Hodge pair.
* framedTraceComparison (§3.0) needs even-filtered relative TC⁻, q-PD Čech
  models and the enhanced coordinate pair with its multiplicative refinements.
* canonicalFramedTrace (§3.1) needs enhanced canonical and coordinate pairs,
  relative TC⁻ over ku, and their multiplicative comparison.
* numberFieldTraceRealisation (§4.1) needs the relative Habiro ring,
  cyclonic THH over KU and its genuine fixed-point limit.
* numberFieldTraceExports (§4.2) needs the relative Habiro ring, cyclonic spectra,
  genuine finite-subgroup fixed points of THH over KU and the Taylor equalizer.

The arithmetic exponent predicates and trace inversion condition are README definitions
and Checks. They do not supply these missing carriers or substitute for the headline theorems.
-/

